# Sleight of Mind changes Purelace's white instruction to blue while it is on the stack (CR 612.2).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Purelace
Sleight of Mind
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Purelace.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sleight of Mind.Cast(Stack.Purelace)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Colors(White)
Bot1.Colors(Blue)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Colors = Blue
